# Context filter for `docker build -f pldi26ae_lower/Dockerfile ..` (from inside pldi26ae_lower/, as its README says),
# read by BuildKit in preference to the repository's root `.dockerignore`, which it REPLACES
# rather than extends -- so this file repeats the root's entries, leaves out only `pldi26ae_lower`
# itself, and re-admits the three files under `script/` that `pldi26ae_lower/run.sh` runs.  Without it
# the root file removes both from the context and the image cannot run the experiment; until
# 2026-11-03 the README worked round that by copying the old runner to the top directory
# before the build.  Requires BuildKit (the default since Docker 23.0).

.git
_build
.vscode

cav21ae_dt
cav21ae_rel
popl24ae
icfp24ae
oopsla25ae
pldi26ae_omega
cav26ae
script/starexec
learner
script

# what run.sh runs (the root file excludes all of script/)
!script/run_corpus.sh
!script/bench_runs.txt
!script/run_bench.sh
